"Display the status of skips.\n"
"Usage: info skip [NUMBER | RANGES]...\n"
"You can specify numbers (e.g. \"info skip 1 3\"), \n"
"ranges (e.g. \"info skip 4-8\"), or both (e.g. \"info skip 1 3 4-8\").\n"
